<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Thanks, but using low-level commands is faster. For us speed (and thus accuracy) is very important.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I have tested your code on my computer and the average difference from a second is &lt;code&gt;+0.00006222222222222222&lt;/code&gt;, which again is more by two decimal places than the difference of the &lt;code&gt;negative_timer&lt;/code&gt; (which is &lt;code&gt;-0.000000676723442&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
